   "he": "מְסַנְּנִין אֶת הַיַּיִן בְּסוּדָרִין. אָמַר רַב שִׁימִי בַּר חִיָּיא: וּבִלְבַד שֶׁלֹּא יַעֲשֶׂה גּוּמָּא.",
   "en": "We learned in the mishna: «One may filter wine through cloths» on Shabbat. «Rav Shimi bar Ḥiyya said:» This is permitted «provided one does not make an indentation» in the cloth, making it into a receptacle, as one must diverge from the usual, weekday manner of performing this activity."
